diff --git a/app.py b/app.py
--- a/app.py
+++ b/app.py
@@
+# Telegram automatic pick delivery fix
+# - auto picks now persist high-score SHARK recommendations as published picks
+# - automatic Telegram destinations always include TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID as global channel
+# - private linked users are added by FREE/PRO/ELITE membership eligibility
+# - auto_pick messages use pick_id + destination dedupe keys
+# - diagnostics expose last_auto_pick and pending auto_pick queue
+
@@ refresh_auto_picks_basic
+MIN_SHARK_SCORE_FOR_AUTO_SEND / AUTO_PICKS_MIN_SCORE now control candidate score.
+MAX_AUTO_PICKS_PER_DAY now limits persisted automatic picks.
+Candidates are persisted through ensure_auto_pick_from_recommendation().
+Duplicate match/market/selection/source combinations are skipped safely.
+
@@ create_or_update_pick
+Added ensure_auto_pick_from_recommendation(rec).
+Creates deterministic pick_id from match_id + market + selection.
+Checks existing picks before insert.
+Logs [AUTO_PICKS] created/skipped events.
+
@@ telegram_subscribers
+Added telegram_auto_destinations(required_membership, include_global=True).
+Always adds TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID as channel destination when configured.
+Adds linked private subscribers only when their membership allows the pick.
+Deduplicates destinations by chat_id.
+
@@ enqueue_daily_picks
-Automatic daily picks depended on PRO/ELITE subscribers only.
+Automatic daily picks now use telegram_auto_destinations("PRO").
+The global channel receives picks even if there are no private linked users.
+
@@ telegram delivery
+Added enqueue_auto_pick_alerts(force=False, limit=6).
+Finds eligible published auto picks.
+Filters by MIN_SHARK_SCORE_FOR_AUTO_SEND.
+Enqueues message_type=auto_pick per destination.
+Uses telegram_dedupe_key("auto_pick", pick_id, chat_id) so the first send is allowed and real duplicates are skipped.
+Logs [QUEUE] decisions.
+
@@ process_premium_telegram_queue
-Delivery logs used generic "send".
+Delivery logs now use [TELEGRAM] with masked chat_id, queue_id and result.
+
@@ telegram_diagnostics
+Adds last_auto_pick.
+Adds auto_pick_pending.
+last_auto now includes [AUTO_PICKS], [QUEUE] and [TELEGRAM] events.
+
@@ telegram_scheduler_delivery
+When auto_daily_picks is due, scheduler now runs enqueue_auto_pick_alerts() before the daily summary.
+The queue is processed afterwards by the existing process_premium_telegram_queue().
+
@@ admin repair actions
+Admin repair now queues auto picks as well as daily matches and daily picks.
+API /api/telegram/repair-automatic also returns queued_auto_picks.
